{"generalSituation":"未來一兩日廣東沿岸風勢微弱，該區天色大致良好，天氣酷熱。同時，位於北部灣的低壓區會為該區帶來驟雨。而位於呂宋以西的熱帶氣旋鯨魚會在今日於呂宋附近的南海中部徘徊，隨後向東移向呂宋，並逐漸減弱。此外，位於西北太平洋的熱帶氣旋白海豚會在今明兩日橫過日本以南海域，並在本週後期橫過琉球群島，移向東海一帶，但隨後路徑存在變數，有較大機會於東海至華東一帶轉向偏北方向移動。受白海豚的外圍下沉氣流影響，週末期間華南天色普遍晴朗，內陸地區極端酷熱，而高溫亦會觸發雷雨。","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20260805","week":"星期三","forecastWind":"微風2級。","forecastWeather":"部分時間有陽光，局部地區有驟雨。日間酷熱。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":33,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":65,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":51,"PSR":"低"},{"forecastDate":"20260806","week":"星期四","forecastWind":"微風2級。","forecastWeather":"部分時間有陽光。日間酷熱。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":33,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":65,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":51,"PSR":"低"},{"forecastDate":"20260807","week":"星期五","forecastWind":"微風2級，漸轉西風3至4級。","forecastWeather":"部分時間有陽光，日間酷熱。稍後局部地區有驟雨及雷暴。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":33,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":65,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":53,"PSR":"中低"},{"forecastDate":"20260808","week":"星期六","forecastWind":"西至西北風4級，稍後離岸及高地5級。","forecastWeather":"大致天晴，日間酷熱。早晚局部地區有驟雨及雷暴。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":34,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":60,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":90,"PSR":"中低"},{"forecastDate":"20260809","week":"星期日","forecastWind":"西至西南風4級，離岸及高地5級。","forecastWeather":"大致天晴。日間酷熱，但稍後局部地區有驟雨。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":34,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":28,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":60,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":90,"PSR":"低"},{"forecastDate":"20260810","week":"星期一","forecastWind":"西至西南風4級，離岸及高地5級。","forecastWeather":"部分時間有陽光，有一兩陣驟雨。日間酷熱。","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":33,"un